    "voiceover": {
      "text": "Step One: Before you lift anything, always assess the load. Ask yourself: Is this bucket too heavy for me to carry alone? Is it filled with water that might spill? Are there cleaning supplies that might be unstable? Never assume you can lift something alone. Always check the weight and contents. If you are unsure, ask for help from a colleague. It is better to be safe than sorry.",
