      "text": "Step Two: Position your feet correctly before lifting. Stand with your feet about shoulder-width apart. Place one foot slightly forward. This gives you a stable, balanced stance. Good foot position is the foundation for safe lifting. Your feet should be firmly on the floor, and you should feel balanced and ready to move. Never rush this step.",
