    "voiceover": {
      "text": "Step Four: Grip and Lift. Get a firm grip on the bucket with both hands. Hold the bucket close to your body. This reduces strain on your back. Now, using the strength in your legs, not your back, push through your heels and stand up smoothly. Keep the movement controlled and smooth. Never jerk the bucket or make sudden movements. Your legs are much stronger than your back and are designed for this type of work.",
      "start_frame": 2400,
      "duration_frames": 720,
      "audio_file": "voiceover_scene_5.mp3"
