    "voiceover": {
      "text": "Step Five: Carrying Safely. Once you are holding the bucket, keep it close to your body at waist height. Maintain an upright posture and avoid twisting your spine. Your feet should move first, then your body follows. Never twist your torso while holding a heavy bucket. Walk carefully through your cleaning area, watch for obstacles and hazards in your path, and stay focused on your destination. Safe carrying prevents accidents and injuries.",
      "start_frame": 3120,
      "duration_frames": 600,
      "audio_file": "voiceover_scene_6.mp3"
